{"vid":"iRr9v_shgbY","source":"iRr9v_shgbY.en.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0.1,"txt":"I was appointed as goodwill ambassador"},{"t":2.8,"txt":"for UN Women 6 months ago and the more"},{"t":6.5,"txt":"I've spoken about feminism the more I"},{"t":9.2,"txt":"have realized that fighting for women's"},{"t":12.3,"txt":"rights has too often become synonymous"},{"t":15.3,"txt":"with man-hating if there is one thing I"},{"t":21,"txt":"know for certain it is that this has to"},{"t":26.3,"txt":"stop for the record feminism by"},{"t":31.5,"txt":"definition is the belief that men and"},{"t":35.6,"txt":"women should have equal rights and"},{"t":37.8,"txt":"opportunities it is the theory of the"},{"t":42.3,"txt":"political economic and social equality"},{"t":45.6,"txt":"of the sexes I started questioning"},{"t":50,"txt":"gender-based assumptions a long time ago"},{"t":52.9,"txt":"when I was 8 I was confused being called"},{"t":57.4,"txt":"bossy because I wanted to direct the"},{"t":61.2,"txt":"plays that we would put on for our"},{"t":62.7,"txt":"parents but the boys were not while at"},{"t":67.4,"txt":"14 I started to be sexualized by certain"},{"t":70.6,"txt":"elements of the media when at 15 my"},{"t":74.8,"txt":"girlfriend's started dropping out of"},{"t":76.5,"txt":"their beloved sports teams because they"},{"t":78.7,"txt":"didn't want to appear muscley when at 18"},{"t":82.7,"txt":"my male friends were unable to express"},{"t":86.1,"txt":"their feelings I decided that I was a"},{"t":91.3,"txt":"feminist and this seemed uncomplicated"},{"t":94.1,"txt":"to me but my recent research has shown"},{"t":98,"txt":"me that feminism has become an unpopular"},{"t":101.8,"txt":"word women are choosing not to identify"},{"t":108.5,"txt":"as feminists apparently I am among the"},{"t":115.7,"txt":"ranks of women whose expressions are"},{"t":118.2,"txt":"seen as too strong too aggressive"},{"t":123.7,"txt":"isolating and anti-men unattractive even"},{"t":131.8,"txt":"why has the word become such an"},{"t":136.1,"txt":"uncomfortable one I am from Britain and"},{"t":141.8,"txt":"I think it is right that I am paid the"},{"t":145.2,"txt":"same as my male counterparts I think it"},{"t":149.1,"txt":"is right that I should be able to make"},{"t":151.5,"txt":"decisions about my own body I think"},{"t":155.3,"txt":"[Applause]"},{"t":164.8,"txt":"I think it is right that women be"},{"t":167.9,"txt":"involved on my behalf in the policies"},{"t":170.9,"txt":"and the decisions that will affect my"},{"t":172.9,"txt":"life I think it is right that's socially"},{"t":177.9,"txt":"I am afforded the same respect as men"},{"t":183,"txt":"but sadly I can say that there is no one"},{"t":188.5,"txt":"country in the world where all women can"},{"t":192.5,"txt":"expect to receive these rights no"},{"t":196.5,"txt":"country in the world can yet say that"},{"t":200,"txt":"they have achieved gender equality these"},{"t":204.4,"txt":"rights I consider to be human rights but"},{"t":208.8,"txt":"I am one of the lucky ones my life is a"},{"t":212.7,"txt":"sheer privilege because my parents"},{"t":215.9,"txt":"didn't love me less because I was born a"},{"t":218.6,"txt":"daughter my school did not limit me"},{"t":222.3,"txt":"because I was a girl my mentors didn't"},{"t":227.6,"txt":"assume that I would go less far because"},{"t":230.5,"txt":"I might give birth to a child one day"},{"t":234,"txt":"these influences with agenda equality"},{"t":237.4,"txt":"ambassadors that made me who I am today"},{"t":241.1,"txt":"they may not know it but they are the"},{"t":244.5,"txt":"inadvertent feminists who are changing"},{"t":246.7,"txt":"the world today we need more of those"},{"t":250.1,"txt":"and if you still hate the word it is not"},{"t":254.8,"txt":"the word that is important it's the idea"},{"t":259.8,"txt":"and the ambition behind it because not"},{"t":264,"txt":"all women have received the same rights"},{"t":266.7,"txt":"that I have in fact statistically very"},{"t":272.1,"txt":"few have been in 1997 Hillary Clinton"},{"t":278.9,"txt":"made a famous speech in Beijing about"},{"t":280.7,"txt":"women's rights sadly many of the things"},{"t":284.6,"txt":"that she wanted to change are still true"},{"t":287.8,"txt":"today but what stood out for me the most"},{"t":292.2,"txt":"was that less than 30 percent"},{"t":295.3,"txt":"of the audience were male how can we"},{"t":301.1,"txt":"affect change in the world when only"},{"t":303.8,"txt":"half of it is invited or feel welcome to"},{"t":307.5,"txt":"participate in the conversation men I"},{"t":313.6,"txt":"would like to take this opportunity to"},{"t":316.5,"txt":"extend your formal invitation"},{"t":332.1,"txt":"gender equality is your issue too"},{"t":337.5,"txt":"because to date I've seen my father's"},{"t":341.6,"txt":"role as a parent being valued less by"},{"t":344.8,"txt":"society despite my needing his presence"},{"t":348,"txt":"as a child as much as my mother's I've"},{"t":351,"txt":"seen young men suffering from mental"},{"t":353.8,"txt":"illness unable to ask for help for fear"},{"t":357.3,"txt":"it would make them less of a men or less"},{"t":361.5,"txt":"of a man in fact in the UK suicide is"},{"t":367.6,"txt":"the biggest killer of men between 20 to"},{"t":370.6,"txt":"49 eclipsing road accidents cancer and"},{"t":374.8,"txt":"coronary heart disease I've seen men"},{"t":379.6,"txt":"made fragile and insecure by a distorted"},{"t":382.5,"txt":"sense of what constitutes male success"},{"t":387.9,"txt":"men don't have the benefits of equality"},{"t":391.2,"txt":"either we don't often talk about men"},{"t":395.7,"txt":"being imprisoned by gender stereotypes"},{"t":398.1,"txt":"but I can see that they are and that"},{"t":402.1,"txt":"when they are free things will change"},{"t":405.3,"txt":"for women as a natural consequence if"},{"t":409.8,"txt":"men don't have to be aggressive in order"},{"t":413.4,"txt":"to be accepted women won't feel"},{"t":415.9,"txt":"compelled to be submissive if men don't"},{"t":419.8,"txt":"have to control women won't have to be"},{"t":422.8,"txt":"controlled both men and women should"},{"t":426.5,"txt":"feel free to be sensitive both men and"},{"t":429.9,"txt":"women should feel free to be strong it"},{"t":433.4,"txt":"is time that we all perceive gender on a"},{"t":436.2,"txt":"spectrum instead of two sets of opposing"},{"t":440.1,"txt":"ideals"},{"t":449,"txt":"if we stop defining each other by what"},{"t":452.3,"txt":"we are not and start defining ourselves"},{"t":454.8,"txt":"by who we are we can all be freer and"},{"t":459.3,"txt":"this is what Heath"},{"t":461.8,"txt":"is about it's about freedom I want men"},{"t":468.1,"txt":"to take up this mantle so that their"},{"t":470.5,"txt":"daughters sisters and mothers can be"},{"t":472.9,"txt":"free from prejudice but also so that"},{"t":476.2,"txt":"their sons have permission to be"},{"t":477.8,"txt":"vulnerable and human to reclaim those"},{"t":481.5,"txt":"parts of themselves they abandoned and"},{"t":483.4,"txt":"in doing so be a more true and complete"},{"t":487.8,"txt":"version of themselves"},{"t":490.4,"txt":"you might be thinking who is this Harry"},{"t":493.6,"txt":"Potter girl and what is she doing"},{"t":497.2,"txt":"speaking at the UN and it's a really"},{"t":499.2,"txt":"good question I've been asking myself"},{"t":501.3,"txt":"the same thing all I know is that I care"},{"t":506.6,"txt":"about this problem and I want to make it"},{"t":509.4,"txt":"better and having seen what I've seen"},{"t":512,"txt":"and given the chance I feel it is my"},{"t":516.4,"txt":"responsibility to say something"},{"t":521,"txt":"statesman Edmund Burke said all that is"},{"t":524.9,"txt":"needed for the forces of evil to triumph"},{"t":527.5,"txt":"is for good men and women to do nothing"},{"t":533,"txt":"in my nervousness for this speech and in"},{"t":538.6,"txt":"my moments of doubt I've told myself"},{"t":542,"txt":"firmly if not me who if not now when if"},{"t":552.1,"txt":"you have similar doubts when"},{"t":554.2,"txt":"opportunities are presented to you I"},{"t":557,"txt":"hope that those words will be helpful"},{"t":561.5,"txt":"because the reality is that if we do"},{"t":567.5,"txt":"nothing it will take 75 years or for me"},{"t":572.6,"txt":"it to be nearly a hundred before women"},{"t":576.1,"txt":"can expect to be paid the same as men"},{"t":579.5,"txt":"for the same work fifteen point five"},{"t":583.8,"txt":"million girls will be married in the"},{"t":585.9,"txt":"next 16 years as children and at current"},{"t":590.9,"txt":"rates it won't be until two thousand and"},{"t":593.8,"txt":"eighty six before all rural African"},{"t":597,"txt":"girls can have a secondary education if"},{"t":602.6,"txt":"you believe in equality you might be one"},{"t":607.5,"txt":"of those inadvertent feminists that I"},{"t":609.6,"txt":"spoke of earlier and for this I applaud"},{"t":613.8,"txt":"you we are struggling for a uniting word"},{"t":618.6,"txt":"but the good news is that we have a"},{"t":622.1,"txt":"uniting movement it is called he for she"},{"t":626.2,"txt":"I am inviting you to step forward to be"},{"t":632.7,"txt":"seen and to ask yourself if not me who"},{"t":639.2,"txt":"if not now when"},{"t":644.2,"txt":"thank you very very much"}],"words":[{"t":0.149,"w":"I"},{"t":0.179,"w":"was"},{"t":1.14,"w":"appointed"},{"t":1.709,"w":"as"},{"t":1.92,"w":"goodwill"},{"t":2.52,"w":"ambassador"},{"t":2.82,"w":"for"},{"t":3.36,"w":"UN"},{"t":3.57,"w":"Women"},{"t":3.6,"w":"6"},{"t":4.14,"w":"months"},{"t":4.41,"w":"ago"},{"t":4.529,"w":"and"},{"t":5.33,"w":"the"},{"t":6.33,"w":"more"},{"t":6.48,"w":"I've"},{"t":6.6,"w":"spoken"},{"t":6.96,"w":"about"},{"t":7.2,"w":"feminism"},{"t":8,"w":"the"},{"t":9,"w":"more"},{"t":9.21,"w":"I"},{"t":9.24,"w":"have"},{"t":9.69,"w":"realized"},{"t":10.139,"w":"that"},{"t":10.61,"w":"fighting"},{"t":11.61,"w":"for"},{"t":12,"w":"women's"},{"t":12.269,"w":"rights"},{"t":12.679,"w":"has"},{"t":13.679,"w":"too"},{"t":13.92,